{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Calvin is the sole survivor of </strong><br><strong>a Halloween ritual gone wrong.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 .\u2726 \u2727 \u2726. \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">His friends vanished, and in an attempt to re-do the ritual to find them, he became <br>trapped in a place where the line between life and death keeps getting blurrier. <br>He will have to travel through different biomes, help local spirits and face powerful <br>entities and bosses\u2014twisted souls who, like him, tried to defy loss but became <br>consumed by it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/9be418653c273b193cd34fd8288eff08.poster.avif?t=1759758680\" width=900 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/9be418653c273b193cd34fd8288eff08.webm?t=1759758680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 .\u2726 Explore a charming but hostile world \u2726. \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u00a0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Traverse a beautiful and dangerous hand-crafted world with multiple biomes <br>and unexpected twists along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/1a4c793b1a72df4cf54b7173efeecabc.poster.avif?t=1759758680\" width=900 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/1a4c793b1a72df4cf54b7173efeecabc.webm?t=1759758680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 .\u2726 Encounter local spirits \u2726. \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Interact with local spirits to find out about their stories and help them. <br>Some may help you with your quest of finding your friends...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/92f9150d6574b943eeb77dde955d3ec7.poster.avif?t=1759758680\" width=900 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/92f9150d6574b943eeb77dde955d3ec7.webm?t=1759758680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 .\u2726 Fight entities \u2726. \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face off resentful spirits in fast-paced and skill-based combats. <br>Use your stick along with special abilities to end them all. <br>Encounter bosses along the way, confront them and learn more about their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/9551ff15e5cde9abd85ecf8e2614df82.poster.avif?t=1759758680\" width=900 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/extras/9551ff15e5cde9abd85ecf8e2614df82.webm?t=1759758680\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500 .\u2726 Discover the truth \u2726. \u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Speak with the dead, complete their quests and help them move on while gathering <br>clues to slowly uncover what truly happened on that Halloween night and why <br>exactly you're here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3710830?t=1759758680","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/ef392318c8943412a1d669ed3bc167d89b41f602/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759758680","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/7e19927e4217770fb8c911a6723bbbf104cf376e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759758680","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710830/7e19927e4217770fb8c911a6723bbbf104cf376e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759758680","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Curses' narrative sometimes deals with mature subject matter. While we treat these themes with sensitivity and care, we recommend parental guidance to help younger play